<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Legal" updated="30 August 2026">
  <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Mobile number</strong> — your identifier, used to send login codes.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Profile details</strong> — name, city, date of birth, playing level,
      height, playing hand, preferred events, photo and gear, to the extent you choose
      to provide them.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Emergency contact</strong> — visible only to club admins.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Activity</strong> — tournament entries and results.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Payment records</strong> — amount, date, period and the Razorpay reference.
      We never see or store your card or UPI credentials.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Why we use it</h2>
  <p>
    To run your membership: verify who you are, take payments, publish the
    roster and fixtures, and contact you about club matters. We rely on the
    contract with you and our legitimate interest in running the club.
  </p>

  <h2>3. What is public</h2>
  <p>
    Your profile appears on the public roster only if you switch it on, and you
    can switch it off at any time from your dashboard. Even when public, your
    mobile number, date of birth and emergency contact are never shown.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Razorpay</strong> — to process payments (their privacy policy applies).
    </li>
    <li><strong>Gupshup / WhatsApp</strong> — to deliver your login codes.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Club admins</strong> — for membership and dues administration.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your data or share it for advertising.</p>

  <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Profile and activity data for as long as you are a member, and for [X]
    months afterwards. Payment records are retained for [8] years to meet Indian
    tax and accounting requirements. Login codes are deleted shortly after use.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can access, correct or delete your data, or ask for a copy, by emailing
    [contact email]. Most of it you can edit yourself from your dashboard. We
    respond within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>
    Login codes are stored only as salted hashes, sessions use signed HTTP-only
    cookies, and payment records can only be written by our server. No system is
    perfectly secure, but we take these measures seriously.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>[Legal entity name], [address]. Email [contact email].</p>
</LegalPage>
